%H A121337 F. Kammüller and J. W. Sanders, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-540-31862-0_23">Idempotent relations in Isabelle/HOL</a>, International Colloquium on Theoretical Aspects of Computing, ICTAC'04. Volume 3407 of Lecture Notes in Computer Science, Springer-Verlag (2005).
